      "content": "6.1 Mineral Resources"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Rajasthan is often called the 'Museum of Minerals'. It is a leading state in production of several important minerals and has over 79 varieties of minerals. Rajasthan contributes significantly to India's mineral production.",
      "id": "cys2t28"
